ft":1.66,"evidence_tier":"sparse"},{"concept_id":"urolithiasis","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":1,"lift":2.39,"evidence_tier":"sparse"}],"lead_score":0.5562},"texts":{"dsc:4.59":{"ref":"De materia medica 4.59","headword":"περιστέριον","lang":"grc","source":"dioscorides","text":"περιστέριον· φύεται ἐν τοῖς ἐφύδροις τόποις, δοκεῖ δὲ ὠνομάσθαι ἐκ τοῦ τὰς περιστερὰς ἡδέως ἐνδιατρίβειν αὐτῇ. πόα δ᾿ ἐστὶ σπιθαμῆς ἔχουσα τὸ ὕψος ἢ καὶ μεῖζον, πέταλα ἐντετμημένα, ὑπόλευκα, ἐκπεφυκότα ἐκ τοῦ καυλοῦ· μονόκλαδος δʼ ὡς τὸ πολὺ καὶ μονόρριζος εὑρίσκεται. δοκεῖ δὲ τὰ φύλλα σὺν ῥοδίνῳ ἢ στέατι χοιρείῳ νεαρῷ προστιθέμενα ἀνωδυνίαν ὑστέρας ποιεῖν στέλλει δὲ καὶ ἐρυσιπέλατα σὺν ὄξει καταπλασθεῖσα καὶ σηπεδόνας ἐπέχει καὶ τραύματα κολλᾷ καὶ ἀπουλοῖ τὰ παλαιὰ σύν μέλιτι.","spans":[{"start":334,"end":340,"concept_id":"pain","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":344,"end":351,"concept_id":"uterine_disorders","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":374,"end":382,"concept_id":"erysipelas","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":413,"end":420,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":434,"end":440,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":453,"end":458,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"action"}]},"cul:316-vervain":{"ref":"Culpeper, Complete Herbal: Vervain","headword":"Vervain","lang":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"This is an herb of Venus, and excellent for the womb to strengthen and remedy all the cold griefs of it, as Plantain doth the hot. Vervain is hot and dry, opening obstructions, cleansing and healing. It helps the yellow jaundice, the dropsy and the gout; it kills and expels worms in the belly, and causes a good colour in the face and body, strengthens as well as corrects the diseases of the stomach, liver, and spleen; helps the cough, wheezings, and shortness of breath, and all the defects of the reins and bladder, expelling the gravel and stone. It is held to be good against the biting of serpents, and other venomous beasts, against the plague, and both tertian and quartan agues. It consolidates and heals also all wounds, both inward and outward, stays bleedings, and used with some honey, heals all old ulcers and fistulas in the legs or other parts of the body; as also those ulcers that happen in the mouth; or used with hog’s grease, it helps the swellings and pains of the secret parts in man or woman, also for the piles or hæmorrhoids; applied with some oil of roses and vinegar unto the forehead and temples, it eases the inveterate pains and ache of the head, and is good for those that are frantic. The leaves bruised, or the juice of them mixed with some vinegar, doth wonderfully cleanse the skin, and takes away morphew, freckles, fistulas, and other such like inflamations and deformities of the skin in any parts of the body. The distilled water of the herb when it is in full strength, dropped into the eyes, cleanses them from films, clouds, or mists, that darken the sight, and wonderfully strengthens the optic nerves. The said water is very powerful in all the diseases aforesaid, either inward or outward, whether they be old corroding sores, or green wounds. The dried root, and peeled, is known to be excellently good against all scrophulous and scorbutic habits of body, by being tied to the pit of the stomach, by a piece of white ribband round the neck.","spans":[{"start":48,"end":52,"concept_id":"uterine_disorders","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":220,"end":228,"concept_id":"jaundice","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":234,"end":240,"concept_id":"edema_dropsy","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":249,"end":253,"concept_id":"gout","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":275,"end":280,"concept_id":"helminthiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":378,"end":401,"concept_id":"dyspepsia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":414,"end":420,"concept_id":"spleen_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":432,"end":437,"concept_id":"cough","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":439,"end":448,"concept_id":"asthma_dyspnea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":454,"end":473,"concept_id":"asthma_dyspnea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":502,"end":507,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":512,"end":519,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":535,"end":541,"concept_id":"urolithiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":546,"end":551,"concept_id":"urolithiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":587,"end":596,"concept_id":"envenomation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":597,"end":605,"concept_id":"envenomation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":617,"end":625,"concept_id":"envenomation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":646,"end":652,"concept_id":"plague","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":663,"end":670,"concept_id":"malaria","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":675,"end":682,"concept_id":"malaria","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":725,"end":731,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":764,"end":773,"concept_id":"hemorrhage","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":815,"end":821,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":826,"end":834,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":889,"end":920,"concept_id":"mouth_gums","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1032,"end":1037,"concept_id":"hemorrhoids","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1041,"end":1052,"concept_id":"hemorrhoids","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1152,"end":1178,"concept_id":"headache","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1211,"end":1218,"concept_id":"delirium","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1303,"end":1319,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1336,"end":1343,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1345,"end":1353,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1355,"end":1363,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1385,"end":1397,"concept_id":"inflammation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1402,"end":1413,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1555,"end":1560,"concept_id":"eye_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1573,"end":1578,"concept_id":"eye_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1768,"end":1773,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1784,"end":1790,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1864,"end":1875,"concept_id":"scrofula","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1880,"end":1889,"concept_id":"scurvy","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"gloss":{"dsc:4.59":{"334":"anodyne (ἀνώδυνος)","344":"the womb (ὑστέρα, μήτρα)","374":"erysipelas","413":"putrefying sores (σηπεδόνες)","434":"wounds (τραύματα)","453":"cicatrising (ἀπουλοῖ)"},"cul:316-vervain":{"48":"womb","220":"yellow jaundice, black jaundice","234":"dropsy, dropsies","249":"gout","275":"worms (intestinal)","378":"pains / gnawing / heat of the stomach","414":"spleen: hardness, swelling, stoppings of the spleen","432":"cough, coughs","439":"wheezing, wheesing","454":"shortness of breath: dyspnoea","502":"reins: kidneys","512":"bladder","535":"gravel: small urinary concretions","546":"the stone (urinary calculus)","587":"biting / stinging of (serpents, scorpions, beasts)","597":"serpents, vipers, adders, scorpions, wasps","617":"venomous beasts / creatures","646":"plague","663":"tertian ague (fever every third day)","675":"quartan ague (fever every fourth day)","725":"wounds (green, fresh, inward, old); wound-herb","764":"bleeding (inward / outward / of wounds)","815":"ulcers (old, foul, running, fretting)","826":"fistula, fistulous ulcers","889":"sores / ulcers / cankers in the mouth","1032":"piles: haemorrhoids","1041":"haemorrhoids (hæmorrhoids, morrhoids)","1152":"pains in the head","1211":"frantic persons","1303":"cleanses / clears the skin or face (cosmetic)","1336":"morphew: scurfy, discoloured skin","1345":"freckles","1355":"fistula, fistulous ulcers","1385":"inflammations","1402":"spots, blemishes, discolourings, deformities of the skin","1555":"film over the ey